{smcl}
{title:Transform variables on spatial locations}

{p 4 8 2}{cmd:spurtransform} {it:varlist}{cmd:, prefix(}{it:name}{cmd:)} [{cmd:transformation(}{it:choice}{cmd:)} {cmd:replace}]{p_end}

{p 4 4 2}Choose {cmd:lbmgls}, {cmd:nn}, {cmd:iso} with {cmd:radius()}, or {cmd:cluster} with {cmd:clustvar()}. Geographic radii use meters.{p_end}

{p 4 4 2}Outputs are created after all selected variables have been transformed. {cmd:replace} applies to exact output names.{p_end}
